{
  "_comment": "Supplement to class-map.json for the catalogue components (tabs, code tabs, code block shell, accordion, file tree, type table, banner, inline table of contents, footnote label) and for three variants that only the catalogue page shows (idea callout, card with icon, card without link). Same format as class-map.json: key = class list of ONE element of the reference DOM, sorted alphabetically; value = Pholio's classes. Two reference class lists that differ only in state (active and inactive code tab, open and closed type table row) map to the same classes; the state is carried by data-active and data-open. fd-steps, fd-step, footnotes, data-footnote-backref, contains-task-list and task-list-item stay verbatim without an entry. The collapsible panel of file tree, type table and inline table of contents has the same class list as the panel of the collapsible table of contents and is therefore listed only in class-map.json (nd-collapsible-panel). The rules are in theme/css/catalogue.css.",
